SUMMARY:Weaverland Valley Consignment Sale
DESCRIPTION:Annual consignment auction fundraiser benefiting Weaverland Valley Fire Dept.\n\nLots of flowers\, crafts\, power tools\, lawn and garden equipment and much more. Food available by WVFD Ladies Auxiliary.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWeaverland Valley Consignment Sale falls on the 3rd Friday & Saturday of May every year. \n\nMud Sales are a unique Lancaster County tradition to raise funds for local volunteer fire companies. See our complete schedule of Lancaster County mud sales. \nPlease Note: Many of the Fire Companies holding mud sales can always use extra help on the days they receive items and the day of the event.  It takes a LOT of labor to put on a mud sale.
