SUMMARY:Flavorfest at Mount Hope Estate
DESCRIPTION:Flavorfest\, held May 23 and 24\, is a premier “Savor the Flavor” event hosted at the scenic Mount Hope Estate. This vibrant festival features sampling and sales from over 30 wineries and distilleries\, making it a paradise for connoisseurs. \nVisitors can browse unique artisan merchants and enjoy diverse lunch options from on-site kitchens. To ensure a hassle-free experience\, a convenient Wine Check Tent in the parking lot allows guests to store their purchases and pick them up as they depart. With free admission and parking\, it’s a delicious way to kick off the spring season. \n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
