SUMMARY:Country Cruise & Fireman’s Festival at Oregon Dairy Farmstead
DESCRIPTION:Save the Date!\n22nd Annual Country Cruise & Fireman’s Festival\nSaturday\, May 23\, 2026\n8 am – 12 noon \nPlease note\, you do not need to pre-register for the show. You will register once you arrive. Please park your car and then make your way to the registration tent.\nCar Show & Fireman’s Festival Info\n\nLocation: 2900 Oregon Pike \, Lititz PA 17543\n$10 Donation for Car Show Registration – All Proceeds Benefit West Earl Fire Co. (Cash only)\nFirst 100 Registered Vehicles Receive a Dash Plaque & Goodie Bag\nFireman’s Choice Award\, Participant’s Choice Award & Door Prizes\nStreet Rods\, Classics\, Bikes\, Trucks & Antiques Welcome!\nLive Music From The Band Forgiven\nJoe’s Famous Wings & Wieners Food Truck\nFun For The Whole Family! Fire Engine Rides – (fee)\nContact: Nancy Shaffer at 717-656-2856 ext 247 or nancy.shaffer@oregondairy.com\n\nALL PROCEEDS BENEFIT THE WEST EARL VOLUNTEER FIRE COMPANY! \n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
