SUMMARY:4th Wednesday Happy Hour in Ephrata\, PA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate community\, live music\, delicious food\, and refreshing drinks at Mainspring of Ephrata’s 4th Wednesday Happy Hours! \nTime: 5:30 – 7:30 PM\nLocation: Downtown Ephrata\, Whistle Stop Plaza\, 16 E. Main Street\, Ephrata\, PA 17522 \nThis summer\, we’re turning up the fun with our Spotlight Series\, highlighting incredible community groups each month. Bring your friends\, family\, and neighbors to enjoy Downtown Ephrata’s all-ages\, welcoming atmosphere. \n2026 Dates\n\nMay 27\nJune 24\nJuly 23\nAugust 26\n\nEvery Friday is a special event somewhere in Lancaster County. Find out more about all the various Friday events in Lancaster County\, PA happening throughout each month. \n  \n\nEvent Calendar for Lancaster\, PA »\n(click here) \nCheck below for a calendar of the upcoming Friday events:\n\nFirst Thursdays in Manheim\nFirst Fridays in Lancaster City\nFirst Friday in Mt. Gretna\nFirst Saturday in Ephrata (June thru Sept)\nSecond Saturday in Lititz\nSecond Fridays in Elizabethtown\nThird Fridays are Music Fridays in Lancaster\nFourth Friday in Columbia\nFourth Friday in Mount Joy\n\nSee our monthly Calendar of Friday Events for descriptions of each. Or\, check our monthly Events Calendar for Lancaster County.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/4th-wednesday-happy-hour-ephrata-pa/2026-05-27/
