SUMMARY:Blippi: Be Like Blippi Tour at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Blippi is coming to Lancaster in the all-new Be Like Blippi Tour! Get ready to see the world more curiously as you move like\, play like\, and explore just like Blippi!  Join Blippi and Meekah live on stage in a high-energy show packed with music\, laughter and surprises\, featuring fan-favorites like “The Excavator Song\,” “Monster Truck\,” “Dino Dance\,” and “Curious Like Me.” This brand-new interactive adventure invites families to put on your orange glasses and unlock the spark of curiosity inside us all—showing that everyone can Be Like Blippi! \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
