SUMMARY:Lee Brice at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an unforgettable night of country music when Lee Brice takes the stage at American Music Theatre! Known for his powerhouse vocals\, heartfelt storytelling\, and chart-topping hits like “Hard to Love\,” “I Don’t Dance\,” “One of Them Girls\,” and “Rumor\,” Brice delivers a show packed with energy\, emotion\, and authenticity. \nA multi-platinum artist\, songwriter\, and CMA award winner\, Lee Brice brings together the raw honesty of classic country with a modern edge that resonates with fans of all ages. Whether he’s performing tender ballads or high-energy anthems\, his passion and stage presence make every song hit home. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
